# Deployment

## Main platform

Push to `main` → Cloudflare Pages auto-builds and deploys.

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    Push[git push main] --> Pages[Cloudflare Pages\nauto-build]
    Pages --> Build[astro build]
    Build --> Edge[Deployed to\nCloudflare Edge]
```

### First deployment — migrations

```bash
wrangler d1 execute egac --file=db/migrations/0001_initial_schema.sql
wrangler d1 execute egac --file=db/migrations/0002_membership_forms.sql
wrangler d1 execute egac --file=db/migrations/0003_update_academy_waitlist_template.sql
wrangler d1 execute egac --file=db/migrations/0004_coach_app.sql
wrangler d1 execute egac --file=db/seed.sql
```

### Secrets

```bash
wrangler secret put RESEND_API_KEY
wrangler secret put ADMIN_TOKEN      # openssl rand -hex 32
wrangler secret put ADMIN_EMAIL
wrangler secret put CRON_SECRET      # openssl rand -hex 32
```

## Coach app

```bash
wrangler deploy --config wrangler-coach.toml
```

Then in **Cloudflare Zero Trust** → Access → Applications → Self-hosted:
- Domain: `coach.eastgrinsteadac.co.uk`
- Policy: Allow coaches by email address

The same Access pattern protects `/docs/*` — add the team's email addresses to a separate `/docs` policy.

## New migration checklist

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    New[Create\ndb/migrations/000N.sql] --> Local[wrangler d1 execute\n--local --file]
    Local --> Tests[npm test]
    Tests --> Prod[wrangler d1 execute\n--file=]
    Prod --> Push[git push main\nauto-deploys]
```

## Cron triggers

Set in **Cloudflare Pages** → your project → Settings → Functions → Cron Triggers:

| Schedule | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `0 9 * * *` | Expire stale invites |
| `*/30 * * * *` | Retry pending invite sends |
| `0 18 * * 2` | Tuesday session reminders |
| `0 9 1 * *` | Academy season rollover |

